# Private Walkietalk credentials. Keep this file owner-only (chmod 600).
# Loaded automatically beside an explicitly selected config file.
# Already-exported environment variables take precedence, even when empty.
# Use literal KEY=value assignments. Quote values containing spaces or #.
# No shell execution, variable expansion, or multiline values.
# Uncomment only the credentials used by your selected backends:
# WALKIETALK_HERMES_TOKEN=replace-with-the-local-Hermes-service-token
# XAI_API_KEY=replace-with-a-billed-xAI-API-key  # grok_api STT/TTS and agent.backend grok_realtime
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=replace-with-a-billed-Anthropic-API-key
# Official CLI logins stay CLI-owned; do not copy OAuth/session files here.
